@dolf3131 Thanks for the feedback. You are correct: with TP=1, the default `uniproc_executor` prevents the PLE offload worker from starting correctly.
I have implemented a quick fix and pushed a new commit. When using the original image, you can work around the issue by specifying `--distributed-executor-backend mp` to use the `multiproc_executor`, as you suggested.  
Thanks again!
